en it is released, then the image digest is\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 66:   pinned to an upstream ROCm release compatible with the platform release\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 67:   train, measured by the release manifest.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 68: - Given an InferenceService selecting the ROCm serving runtime, when deployed\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 69:   to a node pool with AMD Instinct accelerators, then pods schedule with\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 70:   amd.com/gpu resources and become Ready, measured by InferenceService status\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 71:   conditions.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 72: - Given the Konflux build pipeline for the ROCm image variant, when a change\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 73:   lands, then the pipeline builds the image green, measured by a passing\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 74:   Konflux build for the runtime image.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 75: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 76: ## HLR Traceability\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 77: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 78: - HLR-2 (P0): a supported vLLM ROCm serving runtime is productized for the\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 79:   models the validation campaign clears.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 80: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 81: ## Risks\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 82: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 83: - Upstream ROCm image release cadence is controlled by AMD and the upstream\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 84:   communities and may not align with platform release trains.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 85: - Full no-go from the validation campaign removes this epic; a partial\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E002.md: 86:   cleared-model list rewrites its scope.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 33: # Konflux build pipeline for the vLLM ROCm serving image\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 34: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 35: ## Description\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 36: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 37: Onboard the build pipeline for the new vLLM ROCm serving runtime image\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 38: variant into Konflux. The vLLM midstream repos are already Konflux-onboarded\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 39: for existing (CUDA) builds; this epic adds the build configuration for the\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 40: ROCm image variant so it can be built and released through the standard\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 41: platform pipeline. This is a new container image in an existing repo, so no\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 42: repo onboarding is needed — pipeline onboarding starts immediately and runs\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 43: in parallel with the runtime image implementation work.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 44: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 45: ## Scope\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 46: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 47: - Add Konflux build configuration (image variant, build recipe) for the vLLM\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 48:   ROCm serving runtime image in the existing onboarded repos.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 49: - Wire the new image variant into the existing release pipeline so it is\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 50:   built and published per platform version alongside the CUDA builds.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 51: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 52: ## Acceptance Criteria\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E003.md: 53: \nartifacts/ep