ifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 38: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 39: ## Scope\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 40: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 41: - Provide PyTorch ROCm worker images (or approved image references) usable by\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 42:   PyTorchJob pods on AMD Instinct nodes, pinned to upstream ROCm releases.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 43: - Ensure PyTorchJob specs can request amd.com/gpu resources for both\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 44:   single-GPU and multi-GPU (distributed) job topologies.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 45: - Validate functional training on physical AMD Instinct hardware (hardware\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 46:   access is a shared precondition with the serving validation campaign).\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 47: - Validate end-to-end admission and execution of multi-GPU PyTorchJobs\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 48:   through Kueue with amd.com/gpu quota (the quota configuration itself is\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 49:   tracked separately by the Distributed Workloads component; this epic\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 50:   verifies jobs flow through it).\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 51: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 52: ## Acceptance Criteria\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 53: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 54: - Given a PyTorchJob requesting amd.com/gpu resources, when submitted to a\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 55:   cluster with AMD Instinct nodes, then the job runs training to completion\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 56:   on ROCm, measured by successful job completion status for single-GPU and\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 57:   multi-GPU topologies.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 58: - Given a multi-GPU PyTorchJob on ROCm, when submitted through a Kueue-backed\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 59:   queue with amd.com/gpu quota configured, then the job is admitted and all\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 60:   pods run, measured by Kueue admission state and job completion.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 61: - Given the PyTorch ROCm worker images, when used per documentation, then the\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 62:   pinned image references are recorded for release, measured by the release\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 63:   manifest.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 64: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 65: ## HLR Traceability\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 66: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 67: - HLR-3 (P1): PyTorch training on ROCm is supported for single- and\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 68:   multi-GPU jobs admitted through Kueue, with amd.com/gpu quota handling.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 69: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 70: ## Risks\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 71: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 72: - Requires physical AMD Instinct hardware for validation; access is\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 73:   unresolved at strategy level (procurement or partner lab).\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 74: - Upstream PyTorch/ROCm image cadence is controlled by AMD and upstream\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E004.md: 75:   communities.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 29: # Kueue quota handling for amd.com/gpu resources\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 30: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 31: ## Description\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 32: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 33: Extend the Distributed Workloads queueing layer so that AMD GPU resources\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 34: (amd.com/gpu) are handled in Kueue quota and admission. Today GPU quota\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 35: handling covers NVIDIA resources; AMD Instinct nodes expose amd.com/gpu, and\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 36: jobs requesting them must be admitted with correct quota accounting and gang\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 37: semantics (all-or-nothing admission via waitForPodsReady).\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 38: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 39: ## Scope\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 40: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 41: - Define/configure the Kueue resource flavor and ClusterQueue/LocalQueue\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 42:   quota model for amd.com/gpu resources on AMD Instinct node pools.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 43: - Ensure admission of multi-pod distributed jobs requesting amd.com/gpu\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 44:   preserves gang semantics (no partial admission of a job's pods).\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 45: - Validate quota accounting and queueing behavior for jobs requesting\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 46:   amd.com/gpu on physical AMD Instinct hardware (hardware access is a shared\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 47:   precondition with the serving validation campaign).\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 48: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 49: ## Acceptance Criteria\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 50: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 51: - Given a ClusterQueue with an amd.com/gpu flavor, when a workload requests\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 52:   amd.com/gpu resources, then quota is accounted against the flavor and\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 53:   admission respects the configured quota, measured by Kueue workload\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 54:   admission state and quota usage.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 55: - Given a distributed multi-pod workload requesting amd.com/gpu, when the\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 56:   full request cannot be met, then the workload remains pending without\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 57:   partial pod admission (gang semantics), measured by Kueue admission\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 58:   behavior and pending-workload metrics.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 59: - Given queues configured for AMD GPU pools, when training workloads are\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 60:   submitted, then they queue and are admitted in order with correct quota\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 61:   handling, measured by Kueue pending/admitted workload metrics.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 62: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 63: ## HLR Traceability\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 64: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 65: - HLR-3 (P1): PyTorch training on ROCm is supported for single- and\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 66:   multi-GPU jobs admitted through Kueue, with amd.com/gpu quota handling.\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 67: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 68: ## Risks\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 69: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 70: - Requires physical AMD Instinct hardware for end-to-end validation; access\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E005.md: 71:   is unresolved at strategy level (procurement or partner lab).\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E006.md: 33: # Document AMD GPU (ROCm) support\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E006.md: 34: \nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-9020-E006.md: 35: ## Description\nartifacts/epic-tasks/RHAISTRAT-902